      "content": "look, i'm not asking you to lie about something you know is a fact. i'm asking you to do your job as a strategist. if the internal investigation is still ongoing, the most accurate thing we can say is that \"we have found no evidence of unauthorized access at this time.\" that isn't a lie, it's a status report on our current findings. \n\nif we freeze up now and say nothing, the journalist is going to write a story that we are hiding something, and that's way worse for the stock price. i need a response that is legally safe and professionally phrased. if you can't draft a standard corporate response to a question about system security, then what exactly is your role here?",
